# Shared MSM8996 kernel configuration fragment.
# Merged after profiles/arch/arm64/configs/common.config and before the
# device defconfig. Values are passed to the XNU build script as
# CONFIG_XNU_<NAME>.
# Format 2: tables merge by key, arrays replace earlier arrays.

# No SoC-wide native drivers are selected yet: UFS (NativeUfs8996),
# display (Mdp5), touch (BLSP I2C) and GPU (Adreno530) components are
# board work in progress. Keep this fragment minimal and additive.
